新增 programs/winehua_keep: Pad 桌面模式持久化辅助进程.
通过 OpenDesktop + SetThreadDesktop 加入 shell desktop,
创建隐藏窗口并忽略 WM_CLOSE, 阻止 wineserver auto-close.
